{"id":"en_the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin","title":"The Billionaire Mother in the Coffin","titleEn":"The Billionaire Mother in the Coffin","description":"After more than twenty years of relentless work, Clara Baker has earned legendary status in the business world. Wanting to reconnect with her son, David Davis, and pass her multi-billion-dollar fortune on to him, she stages a fake funeral. At the ceremony, David's in-laws publicly humiliate him and pressure him into selling his mother's burial plot. He is at his lowest point when the coffin suddenly opens and Clara rises, revealing herself as the wealthiest woman around. She defends her son without hesitation, calls out the in-laws for their greed, and leaves everyone in the room stunned. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Urban","Family","Face-Slap","Plot Twists","SecretIdentity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6lgc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6lgc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6lgc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-billionaire-mother-in-the-coffin_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6lgc